 ## [Unreleased]

+### Fixed
+
+- Keep text smoothing outside Red/Blue highlight ribbons while preserving reversed ink inside their exact contours.
+- Restore Library Sync Book actions and return to the selected page, sort and search after syncing.
+
+- Store quotes in stock-compatible CrossInk v7 files, with checked color/note companions and lossless legacy migration; retain higher quote limits.
+
+
+- Hide the redundant File Transfer header arrow even when opened from a book; keep the shared Home ribbon and physical Back navigation.
+- Keep the complete Plugins puzzle icon visible, including its top tab.
+
+- Enter hardware deep sleep after saving the sleep screen so a single Power press can wake X4 Pro again.
+
 ### Added

 - Display settings offer light grey, dark grey, and solid saved highlights, with contrasting text and a White option in Dark Mode.

 - Library and Home cover grids show saved reading percentages in high-contrast badges.

+- Custom sleep-screen rotation accepts JPEG, PNG, and the first frame of GIF images alongside BMPs.
+
 - The reader’s swipe-down drawer has a Library shortcut. Display → Frontlight offers independent black border widths from 0 to 16 pixels on each edge to mask light leakage.
 - crASHink adds a reader Library shortcut and independent frontlight leakage borders.

@@ -65,14 +80,6 @@

 ### Fixed

-- Restore Library Sync Book actions and return to the selected page, sort and search after syncing.
-- Hide the redundant File Transfer header arrow even when opened from a book; keep the shared Home ribbon and physical Back navigation.
-- Keep the complete Plugins puzzle icon visible, including its top tab.
-
-- Keep text smoothing outside Red/Blue highlight ribbons while preserving reversed ink inside their exact contours.
-
-- Store quotes in stock-compatible CrossInk v7 files, with checked color/note companions and lossless legacy migration; retain higher quote limits.
-
 - Fix an occasional reboot when putting an X3 or X4 to sleep with plugins enabled (#973).
 - Index EPUBs faster when many table-of-contents entries point to the same chapter file or chapter files are stored out of reading order.
 - Credit EPUB and XTC reading to the correct local day across midnight. Preserve live stats if a save fails, retry updates after SD errors, and finish pending saves before sleep, reader restart, or USB Drive handoff.
